  id: 8
  displayName: Cherry picking
  type: TwistedEvidence
  text: A recent study hinted that this could be effective. They won't report it,
    but if you look at table 3, the data is clear.
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is Cherry Picking. It highlights one tiny piece of data
    (like a single table) while ignoring the full context, the study's conclusion,
    or all other research that contradicts it."
  hintText: Only shows the facts that support one side and hides the facts that disagree.
